### 1. Ambil semua barang inventaris (GET)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/inventaris

### 2. Ambil satu barang berdasarkan ID (GET)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/inventaris/2

### 3. Tambah barang baru (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/inventaris
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "nama": "Mouse",
  "jumlah": 18,
  "kondisi": "Baik"
}